1
00:00:00,945 --> 00:00:02,115
(Howard:)If anything goes down,

2
00:00:02,113 --> 00:00:03,883
(Howard:)we just put Koothrappali
in the driver's seat

3
00:00:03,881 --> 00:00:06,881
(Howard:)and slap a sombrero
on his head.

4
00:00:06,884 --> 00:00:10,684
(Raj:)Dude, how many races can you
offend in a single breath?

5
00:00:10,688 --> 00:00:11,818
(Amy:)I don't know.

6
00:00:11,822 --> 00:00:14,052
(Howard:)Have you watched
the Olympics with me?

7
00:00:15,158 --> 00:00:17,358
(Leonard:)Sheldon, can you believe
that we're driving in a van

8
00:00:17,361 --> 00:00:19,361
(Leonard:)that was owned by one of
the greatest scientific minds

9
00:00:19,363 --> 00:00:21,093
(Leonard:)of the 20th century?

10
00:00:21,098 --> 00:00:22,498
(Leonard:)It's like the Batmobile.

11
00:00:23,233 --> 00:00:24,863
(Leonard:)If Batman was real

12
00:00:24,869 --> 00:00:26,339
(Leonard:)and a physicist

13
00:00:26,337 --> 00:00:29,067
(Leonard:)and his car wasn't cool.

14
00:00:29,073 --> 00:00:30,943
(Sheldon:)It is extraordinary.

15
00:00:30,942 --> 00:00:33,942
(Raj:)Perhaps some of his mojo
will rub off on us.

16
00:00:33,945 --> 00:00:36,345
(Raj:)Maybe between this
and his beach house,

17
00:00:36,347 --> 00:00:38,447
(Raj:)we will be inspired
to greatness.

18
00:00:38,449 --> 00:00:41,579
(Sheldon:)I usually don't put too much
stock in charms and talismans.

19
00:00:41,585 --> 00:00:43,015
(Sheldon:)However, even I must admit

20
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,620
(Sheldon:)feeling Richard Feynman's

21
00:00:44,622 --> 00:00:48,222
(Sheldon:)butt dent cupping
my own bottom...

22
00:00:48,225 --> 00:00:51,065
(Sheldon:)that does get
the creative juices flowing.

23
00:00:52,429 --> 00:00:54,099
(Howard:)Hey, I have to return this van.

24
00:00:54,098 --> 00:00:56,528
(Howard:)Keep your creative juices
in your pants.

25
00:00:56,534 --> 00:00:58,234
(bang and hiss)

26
00:00:58,235 --> 00:00:59,305
(Sheldon:)What was that?

27
00:00:59,303 --> 00:01:00,933
I think it's a tire.

